{
  "slug": "swagger-contract-testing",
  "name": "Swagger Contract Testing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI assistant skills and agents for PactFlow contract testing. Covers the full contract testing lifecycle — from writing and reviewing Pact consumer/provider tests to publishing contracts,\nrunning can-i-deploy checks, and managing your PactFlow workspace.\n\nIncludes:\n- PactFlow skill — expert assistant for Pact and PactFlow; uses the SmartBear MCP server to generate and review tests with AI, publish contracts, verify providers, record deployments, and\nmanage environments, webhooks, and secrets.\n- Drift skill — expert assistant for Drift, PactFlow's OpenAPI contract testing CLI; helps write test cases, configure lifecycle hooks, debug failures, and publish results for\nBi-Directional Contract Testing (BDCT).\n- OpenAPI Parser skill — parses complex OpenAPI specs (anyOf/oneOf/allOf, discriminators, $ref chains, enums, regex patterns) and generates comprehensive Drift test cases covering every\nschema combination.\n- Specialized agents — pact-generator (writes Pact tests from code or specs), pact-reviewer (audits tests for best-practice violations), pact-implementor (builds Pact FFI bindings for new\nlanguages), pact-maintainer (fixes failing verifications and cleans up stale workspace state), and bdct-tester (drives a full BDCT flow end-to-end).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **5 agents**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `drift-testing` (Verifies API implementations against OpenAPI specifications using the Drift CLI, catching spec drift and supporting Bi-Directional Contract Testing…), `openapi-parser` (Parses complex OpenAPI specs and generates Drift test cases from them), `pactflow` (Expert assistant for PactFlow and Pact contract testing)\n- **Agents** (5): `bdct-tester` (Agentic BDCT (Bi-Directional Contract Testing) driver), `pact-generator` (Specialized agent for generating new Pact consumer tests and provider state handlers from existing code, OpenAPI specs, or…), `pact-implementor` (Specialized agent for building a new Pact client library from scratch in any language), `pact-maintainer` (Pact ecosystem maintenance agent), `pact-reviewer` (Specialized agent for reviewing Pact consumer tests and provider verification code)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `smartbear`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install swagger-contract-testing@claude-community` from `pactflow/pactflow-agent-skills` (`plugins/swagger-contract-testing`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
